### 1. GET all rooms (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 2. GET rooms with filters, sorting, and pagination (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?minPrice=500&sort=price&order=DESC&limit=5&offset=0

### 3. GET room statistics (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/stats

### 4. GET room by ID (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/101

### 5. POST create new room (201 Created + Location)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": 301,
  "type": "DELUXE",
  "pricePerNight": 3400.0
}

### 6. PUT update existing room (200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/301
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": 301,
  "type": "DELUXE",
  "pricePerNight": 3600.0
}

### 7. DELETE room by ID (204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/301

### 8. GET all guests (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/guests

### 9. GET guests with filter and sorting (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/guests?lastName=Ганевич&sort=birthDate&order=ASC

### 10. GET guest statistics (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/guests/stats

### 11. POST create guest with Ukrainian text (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/guests
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "passportNumber": "KH998877",
  "firstName": "Тарас",
  "lastName": "Шевченко",
  "birthDate": "1990-03-09"
}

### 12. ERROR 400: Validation error (multiple violations including @ValidPassport)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/guests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passportNumber": "bad-id",
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "Петренко",
  "birthDate": "1998-04-12"
}

### 13. ERROR 400: Malformed JSON
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomNumber": 401, broken

### 14. ERROR 400: Invalid query parameter
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?sort=unknown&order=SIDEWAYS&limit=-5

### 15. ERROR 400: PUT body ID mismatch with path ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/101
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": 999,
  "type": "SINGLE",
  "pricePerNight": 900.0
}

### 16. ERROR 404: Resource not found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/9999

### 17. ERROR 404: Unknown route
GET http://localhost:8080/api/unknown

### 18. ERROR 405: Method Not Allowed
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 19. ERROR 409: Duplicate identity conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": 101,
  "type": "SINGLE",
  "pricePerNight": 900.0
}

### 20. ERROR 415: Unsupported Media Type
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: text/plain

105,SINGLE,950.0
